<title>USA: El Salvador retenders for PL-480 soymeal - agent.</title>
<headline>El Salvador retenders for PL-480 soymeal - agent.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>El Salvador was retendering for 8,000 to 10,000 tonnes U.S. soybean meal in bulk under the PL-480 export program, its U.S. export agent said.</p>
<p>The soymeal, to be delivered June 1-15, would be 48 percent protein and minimum 0.5 percent crude fat and maximum 3.5 percent crude fiber.</p>
<p>Offers were to be submitted no later than May 12 and will be valid until May 13.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
